<div class="section-title">🚀 Big Tech &amp; Startups</div>
<div class="item"><a class="title" href="https://tauri.app/blog/tauri-2-6/?utm_source=tldrnewsletter">Tauri 2.6 ships multiwebview and a new IPC transport (4 minute read)</a>
<p>Tauri 2.6 stabilises multiple webviews per window, replaces the JSON IPC with a binary channel for large payloads and adds tracing spans for every command. Startup time on macOS drops by a third in the benchmarks.</p></div>
<div class="item"><a class="title" href="https://sqlite.org/releaselog/3_51_0.html?utm_source=tldrnewsletter">SQLite 3.51 adds expression indexes on JSONB (3 minute read)</a>
<p>JSONB columns can now carry expression indexes directly, which makes json_extract lookups as fast as a plain column. The release also tightens the query planner for partial indexes.</p></div>
<div class="section-title">🧠 Science &amp; Futuristic Technology</div>
<div class="item"><a class="title" href="https://example-research.org/papers/thermal-batteries?utm_source=tldrnewsletter">Sand batteries heat a whole Finnish town (6 minute read)</a>
<p>A 100 MWh sand battery now covers district heating for Pornainen through the winter, charged by surplus wind power.</p></div>
<div class="section-title">💻 Programming, Design &amp; Data Science</div>
<div class="item"><a class="title" href="https://blog.rust-lang.org/2026/10/02/trait-upcasting.html?utm_source=tldrnewsletter">Trait upcasting lands in stable Rust (5 minute read)</a>
<p>A <code style="background:#f2f2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">&amp;dyn Sub</code> can now coerce to <code style="background:#f2f2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">&amp;dyn Super</code> without a helper method.</p></div>
<div class="item"><a class="title" href="https://svelte.dev/blog/runes-one-year?utm_source=tldrnewsletter">One year of runes (GitHub Repo)</a>
<p>The Svelte team looks back on a year of runes in production and what changed in the compiler output.</p></div>
